sic template</i><i>✓ Export with watermark</i></span>\n        <span class=\"pricing-btn ghost\">Start for free</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pricing-card hot\">\n        <span class=\"pricing-badge\">Suitable for continuous creation</span>\n        <b class=\"pricing-tier\">Pro</b><span class=\"pricing-price\">¥29<small>/month</small></span>\n        <span class=\"pricing-feats\"><i>✓ No limit to projects</i><i>✓ All templates</i><i>✓ High-definition export without watermark</i></span>\n        <span class=\"pricing-btn\">Upgrade to Pro</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"pricing-demo pricing-demo-col\"><small style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">Example prices and benefits</small>\n      <div class=\"pricing-d-toggle\"><b>Pay monthly</b><b class=\"on\">Pay annually <em>Show total price</em></b></div>\n      <div class=\"pricing-d-row\" style=\"max-width:560px\">\n        <div class=\"pricing-card\">\n          <b class=\"pricing-tier\">Free version</b><span class=\"pricing-price\">¥0<small>/month</small></span>\n          <span class=\"pricing-feats\"><i>✓ 10 projects</i><i>✓ Community support</i></span>\n          <span class=\"pricing-btn ghost\">Get started</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pricing-card hot\">\n          <span class=\"pricing-badge\">Suitable for continued use</span>\n          <b class=\"pricing-tier\">Pro</b><span class=\"pricing-price\">¥24<small>/month · Annual payment</small></span>\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">The total annual payment is ¥288 · equivalent to ¥24/month</span>\n          <span class=\"pricing-feats\"><i>✓ No project limit</i><i>✓ Custom domain name</i></span>\n          <span class=\"pricing-btn\">Upgrade yearly</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div class=\"pricing-demo\" style=\"max-width:560px;margin:0 auto\"><small style=\"color:var(--text-3)\">Example prices and benefits</small>\n      <div class=\"pricing-card hot\">\n        <b class=\"pricing-tier\">Pro</b><span class=\"pricing-price\">¥49<small>/month</small></span>\n        <span class=\"pricing-feats\"><i>✓ No project limit</i><i>✓ Custom domain</i><i>✓ Priority support</i></span>\n        <span class=\"pricing-btn\">Upgrade to Pro</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pricing-card\">\n        <b class=\"pricing-tier\">Enterprise</b><span class=\"pricing-price\" style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:2\">Contact us for pricing</span>\n        <span class=\"pricing-feats\"><i>✓ Private deployment</i><i>✓ SLA-backed support</i><i>✓ Dedicated customer success</i></span>\n        <span class=\"pricing-btn ghost\">Contact sales</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<div class=\"pricing-anat\">\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"tier\"><span class=\"pricing-anat-tier\">专业版</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"price\"><span class=\"pricing-anat-price\">¥49<small>/月</small></span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"features\"><span class=\"pricing-anat-feats\">不限项目 · 自定义域名 · 优先支持</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"cta\"><span class=\"pricing-anat-btn\">升级专业版</span></span>\n    </div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"pricing-anat\">\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"tier\"><span class=\"pricing-anat-tier\">Pro</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"price\"><span class=\"pricing-anat-price\">¥49<small>/month</small></span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"features\"><span class=\"pricing-anat-feats\">No project limit · Custom domain name · Priority support</span></span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"cta\"><span class=\"pricing-anat-btn\">Upgrade to Pro</span></span>\n    </div>","parts":[{"key":"tier","cn":"档位卡","en":"Tier","desc":"每档对应一类明确用户或使用范围","desc_en":"Each plan should match a clear user type or use case"},{"key":"price","cn":"价格","en":"Price","desc":"明确币种、计费周期和本次应付总额","desc_en":"State the currency, billing cycle, and total amount due"},{"key":"features","cn":"权益清单","en":"Features","desc":"列出影响选择的关键差异，便于横向比较","desc_en":"List the differences that matter so people can compare plans side by side"},{"key":"cta","cn":"行动入口","en":"CTA","desc":"说明购买、试用、联系销售或当前方案状态","desc_en":"Explain how to purchase, try the plan, contact sales, or view the current plan"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"多档对比","en":"MultiTier","demo":"<span class=\"pricing-v\"><i></i><i class=\"hot\"></i><i></i></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"pricing-v\"><i></i><i class=\"hot\"></i><i></i></span>","when":"存在数类需求清楚不同的用户时","when_en":"When there are several types of users with clearly different needs"},{"cn":"月年切换","en":"Toggle","demo":"<span class=\"pricing-v-toggle\"><b class=\"on\">月付</b><b>年付 · 显示总价</b></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"pricing-v-toggle\"><b class=\"on\">Monthly payment</b><b>Yearly payment · Show total price</b></span>","when":"月付和年付规则都能清楚说明时","when_en":"When the monthly payment and annual payment rules are clearly explained"},{"cn":"单档","en":"Single","demo":"<span class=\"pricing-v-single\">单一价格</span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"pricing-v-single\">Single price</span>","when":"产品只有一种付费方案时","when_en":"When the product has only one payment plan"}],"use":[{"t":"按用户分层选择<b>合适数量的档位</b>，不把三档当成固定模板","m":"pricing-three"},{"t":"推荐档要写明<b>适用对象或数据依据</b>；没有依据时不加推荐标记","m":"pricing-recommend"},{"t":"同时写清<b>月付、年付总价与取消规则</b>，让用户比较实际成本","m":"pricing-anchor"},{"t":"每个可购买或可试用的档位都应有<b>清楚的下一步</b>：可以是 {c:cta}、联系销售或当前方案状态，不必机械放相同按钮","m":"pricing-cta"}],"dont":[{"t":"设置过多相似档位会<b>增加比较成本</b>，应合并无法清楚区分的方案","m":"pricing-many","bad":true},{"t":"标准化个人方案通常应<b>直接说明价格</b>；只有需要评估范围的复杂方案才适合询价","m":"pricing-hidden","bad":true},{"t":"<b>预先勾选</b>付费加购项会改变用户选择，应让用户主动确认","m":"pricing-dark","bad":true},{"t":"首期价格、<b>续费价格和期限</b>都应放在用户容易注意的位置","m":"pricing-fineprint","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"订阅页提供个人、团队和企业三档方案，既有月付也有年付。怎样让用户完成真实成本比较？","options":[{"id":"transparent-plan-comparison","label":"并列说明适用对象、核心权益、计费周期、实际总价和取消规则","feedback":"这些信息共同决定方案是否适合以及实际要付多少，用户能够在同一口径下比较。","correct":true},{"id":"monthly-equivalent-only","label":"只突出年付折算后的最低月均价，把年付总额放到结账页","feedback":"月均价方便比较，但隐藏本次总额会让用户无法在选择前判断真实支出。","correct":false},{"id":"unsupported-popular-plan","label":"给利润最高的方案标“最受欢迎”，不说明适用对象或数据来源","feedback":"推荐标记会影响选择；没有真实依据时，它不能证明该方案更适合当前用户。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A subscription page offers Individual, Team, and Enterprise plans with monthly and annual billing. How can users compare real cost?","options":[{"id":"transparent-plan-comparison","label":"Compare intended users, core benefits, billing period, actual total, and cancellation terms","feedback":"Together these determine fit and actual payment, allowing each plan to be compared on the same basis.","correct":true},{"id":"monthly-equivalent-only","label":"Emphasize only the lowest annual monthly equivalent and reveal the annual total at checkout","feedback":"A monthly equivalent aids comparison, but hiding the charged total prevents users from judging real cost before selection.","correct":false},{"id":"unsupported-popular-plan","label":"Mark the highest-margin plan Most popular without an audience or evidence","feedback":"Recommendations influence choice. Without evidence, the badge cannot show that the plan fits the current user.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请检查定价区：每档写清适用对象、差异权益、币种、计费周期、本次实际总额、续费和取消规则。月均价不能替代年付总额；没有依据就移除“最受欢迎”，并验证手机上仍能比较关键差异。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Audit the pricing section: state intended user, differentiating benefits, currency, billing period, charged total, renewal, and cancellation for every plan. Do not replace annual total with a monthly equivalent, remove unsupported popularity claims, and verify mobile comparison."}},"demoDetail":"<div class=\"pricing-demo pricing-demo-col\"><small style=\"display:block;color:var(--text-3)\">虚构示例 · 上线时填入实际价格、总价与规则</small>\n    <div class=\"pricing-d-toggle\"><b class=\"on\">按月付费</b><b>按年付费 <em>显示年付总价</em></b></div>\n    <div class=\"pricing-d-row\">\n      <div class=\"pricing-card\">\n        <b class=\"pricing-tier\">免费版</b><span class=\"pricing-price\">¥0<small>/月</small></span>\n        <span class=\"pricing-feats\"><i>✓ 10 个项目</i><i>✓ 100 次生成 / 月</i><i>✓ 社区支持</i></span>\n        <span class=\"pricing-btn ghost\">开始使用</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pricing-card hot\">\n        <span class=\"pricing-badge\">适合高频使用者</span>\n        <b class=\"pricing-tier\">专业版</b><span class=\"pricing-price\">¥49<small>/月</small></span>\n        <span class=\"pricing-feats\"><i>✓ 不限项目</i><i>✓ 自定义域名</i><i>✓ 优先支持</i></span>\n        <span class=\"pricing-btn\">升级专业版</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pricing-card\">\n        <b class=\"pricing-tier\">团队版</b><span class=\"pricing-price\">¥199<small>/月</small></span>\n        <span class=\"pricing-feats\"><i>✓ 多人协作</i><i>✓ 权限管理</i><i>✓ 专属客服</i></span>\n        <span class=\"pricing-btn ghost\">联系销售</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>","references":[{"title":"产品、服务与功能的对比表格","source":"NN/g","url":"https://www.nngroup.com/articles/comparison-tables/","title_en":"Comparison Tables for Products, Services, and Features"}],"scenes":["SaaS 三档定价","免费 + 付费双档","月付年付切换","企业版联系销售"],"en":{"demoDetail":"<div class=\"pricing-demo pricing-demo-col\"><small style=\"display:block;color:var(--text-3)\">Fictional example · Replace with your actual prices, totals, and billing terms before publishing</small>\n    <div class=\"pricing-d-toggle\"><b class=\"on\">Pay monthly</b><b>Pay annually <em>Display total annual price</em></b></div>\n    <div class=\"pricing-d-row\">\n      <div class=\"pricing-card\">\n        <b class=\"pricing-tier\">Free</b><span class=\"pricing-price\">¥0<small>/month</small></span>\n        <span class=\"pricing-feats\"><i>✓ 10 projects</i><i>✓ 100 builds/month</i><i>✓ Community support</i></span>\n        <span class=\"pricing-btn ghost\">Get started</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"pricing-card hot\">\n        <span class=\"pricing-badge\">Best for frequent use</spa